B.V2=s(["The website uses your browser's storage to keep you signed in, remember your basket and settings, and work faster. We do not use advertising cookies or sell browsing data.","If you allow notifications, we store a notification address for your device so we can send order updates. You can turn them off in the app or in your browser or phone settings at any time."],t.s)
